 the same place (24 pixels) near 10.0N, 75.7E.", "Trend regimes found by clustering: calmer + warming + wetter (35 pixels); warming + drier + drying soil (10 pixels)."], "caveats": ["NASA POWER here is MERRA-2-based reanalysis at about 0.5 degrees: a model constrained by observations, not a direct measurement.", "Reanalysis can contain sudden jumps when the satellites feeding it change; a trend can partly be such a jump, especially for wind.", "Linear trends only. Clusters show where change is stronger than chance, not why it happened."]}